  "_comment_macros": "dcache_adapter_gf180 binds its tag RAM (ram_2x8x256_1rw, 2x macros) and data RAM (ram_2x8x2048_2rw, 8x macros) to the tech/gf180 vendor gf180mcu_fd_ip_sram hard IP (see lib/memory_tech_lib/tech/gf180/ram_2x8x{256_1rw,2x2048_2rw}_gf180.vhd). MACROS below gives LibreLane the PDK LEF/lib/GDS views for both cell types so they place/route as black boxes instead of being re-synthesized. FP_CORE_UTIL/PL_TARGET_DENSITY_PCT are lowered vs j4_core/smoke to leave floorplan room for the ~10 large fixed SRAM macros (2x sram256x8 + 8x sram512x8) alongside the adapter's control logic.",
